# Fresh process on the same isolated sealed Keeper profile. Verify the exact
# source UUID and both retained assertion IDs against claims_seed.scn's receipt.
settle 3
act claims-open-major-major7
settle 3
assert text Claims
assert snap personal-source-status == available
assert snap personal-write-available == true
assert snap personal-retained-count == 2
assert snap personal-held-count == 1
assert snap personal-withdrawn-count == 1
click .personal-link-history-toggle
settle 3
assert text Independent reason one
assert text Independent reason two
assert text withdrawn at
assert text urn:woodshed:method:computed-formula-relations
assert text urn:woodshed:evidence:v1
act claims-verify-reopen-identities
assert event claims-reopen-identities-match true
capture 01_claims_fresh_reopen
log Claims reopen: source UUID, held assertion ID and withdrawal tombstone retained
